Package: rwimputation
Title: Random Walk data imputation 
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Natalia", "Krajewska", , "natalia.krajewska.pl@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Imputates missing values in data frames and matrices using random walk algorithm on graph of connection between rows of provided data. Handles both numeric and categorical data.
